<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-ζέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boil out</i> or <i>over : break out,</i> in disease,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				861b10
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἐκζέῃ τὸ αἷμα</span>
			Ant. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				19.2
			</span></i> : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέζεσεν γὰρ Οἰδίπου κατεύγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					709
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶσα εὐλέων ἐξέζεσε</span>
			<i>bred</i> worms, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.205
			</span></i> : c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκζεῖν φθειρσί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					4.4
				</span></i>
			 : c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκώληκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					16.20
				</span></i>
			 ; of a country, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μύας</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				6.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ferment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be boiled to a decoction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>.</div>
